- **Percentage fee:** 0.3% of the EUR equivalent of the transfer amount&#xD;
&#xD;
So the total cost is EUR 15.00 plus 0.3% of whatever you send. Note that correspondent bank charges deducted en route are outside Verta's control and are not refunded.&#xD;
